MiniMax-H3 desktop release

This repository contains original Argus/Argus-AiTeam adaptation, packaging, verification, benchmarking, and reporting code for a single-A6000 MiniMax-H3 path. It does not include model weights, adapter weights, Docker layers, credentials, or private caches. One curated generated-media example is included under examples/ with prompt, hash, workload, and validation metadata.

Attribution is preserved for upstream work that informed or is patched by this tree, including MiniMax, vLLM/vLLM-Omni, the NVLabs/Sana Sol-Engine team, the Larry MiniMax-H3 Turbo work, Hugging Face ecosystem packages, PyTorch, Triton, and related open-source dependencies. The A6000 overlay NOTICE, UPSTREAM document, and patch files retain additional file-level attribution.

This NOTICE does not relicense MiniMax-H3 weights, the Turbo adapter, generated content, or third-party software, and does not reassign upstream authorship to the Argus adaptation authors.
